            "review_title": "Review at Ngo Saigon Street Cafe Restaurant",
            "review_text": "jesmac2014\nMunich, Germany11 contributions\n0\nPrice ok but not really good\nOct 2019 • Solo\nOf course, for a Vietnamese people it could be good, however for an European not at all . I saw the menu an order what I saw . They brought me a similar food but not exactly what I ordered. The taste from some food was ok, another very bad! \nI also order a pineapple juice and told that I wish less Ice cubes to have more content of the juice ! Guess that ! I got approximately an empty glass with a little pineapple juice with less ice cubes ! I asked the people , why they didn’t fill in the glass ? They said: “this is what they serve”. \nVery insolent and outrageous. \nIt is funny but at the same time I am paying what I see in the menu card and I expect to get that what I see and pay\nRead more\nWritten October 9, 2019",
