            "review_text": "alan888888\nLos Angeles, California12 contributions\n0\nNice authentic Vietnamese food with reasonable price in District 1.\nDec 2017 • Family\nWe were walking in the VinCom mall in Le Thang Ton, saw many locals having lunch in Ngo Saigon Street. Read their menu, there are many interesting dish on it, decided to try it out in dinner since the restaurant was pack with local dinners. We had a very good dinner for total bill about $55 for 5 persons that including 4 starters, 5 main and 3 desserts and 3 drinks. The foods were good. It is reasonable price in the district 1 area. Wished to find it out earlier. Recommended this restaurant for travelers visiting in How Chi Minh.\nRead more\nWritten December 15, 2017",
