            "review_text": "Rhia C\nPleasanton, California298 contributions\n0\nNothing special\nJul 2017 • Solo\nI had my dinner here last Friday night (28/07/17). I ordered the noodle and the famous spring roll. The noodle is just fine but the spring roll wrapper is like a plastic. I cant bite the wrapper and end up eating the stuff inside. I just took it away and gave it to the hotel reception in my hotel.... \nthis will be my first and last here...😬\nWritten July 29, 2017\nLeKienLki\nDear Rhia C,\n\nWe would like to say \"thank you\" for your feedback about the dish of our restaurant and we are so sorry about the inconvenience. We have noted and we will improve it.\nWe hope to have a chance to serve again soon.\n\nMany thanks!\nRead more\nWritten August 1, 2017\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
